        "description": "<p><a href=\"https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-board-reinstates-jensen-huang-as-president-ceo-and-board-director\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-board-reinstates-j...</a><p><a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-jensen-huang-congress-trump.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/nvidia-jensen-huang-congress...</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50611576\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50611576</a></p>\n<p>Points: 2546</p>\n<p># Comments: 3461</p>",
